      "id": "claim_25c060c4707c4e0889062528be48d719",
      "statement": "Strap stores all data in Postgres 17+/18 and the Next.js server connects directly; there is no database REST endpoint and no Row-Level Security, and authorization is enforced in TypeScript before data is returned.",
