      "id": "claim_4fbf4290c64d4f7aa608250f2f0943f3",
      "statement": "db/schema declares 44 tables across application.ts, auth.ts, and avatars.ts; db/migrations/0000_baseline.sql is the single squashed baseline whose final block contains eight retained atomic functions mirrored in db/functions/baseline.sql; forward-only migrations are generated with npm run db:generate and applied with npm run db:migrate, but Drizzle does not generate function migrations so editing a SQL function requires a new SQL migration and an update to db/functions/baseline.sql.",
