      "statement": "creeds enforces one Personal and one Company workspace per owner through partial unique indexes and a type check, and creed_members carries role (owner/admin/member) with one-owner-per-creed and a (creed_id, user_id) primary key; most tables cascade-delete with users.id and creeds.id.",
